exit: 0
--- stdout
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// A whole sheet, the way one is really drawn: an ISO page, a captioned</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// `|region|` per block tiling the page's grid, and inside each of them</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// `layout: schematic` — the ICs on the scope's track row, every passive seated</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// at the pin it serves, and the router drawing the wires **between parts**.</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// That is the point of the file: a pin that runs straight to a net label says</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// nothing. Rails ride **power flags** wherever they are wanted, and only the</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// six signals that genuinely leave a block are written out as net names</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// [SPEC 16].</span>
<span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// `density:` is screen resolution alone — px per millimetre — so the paper</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// stays true-scale in print [SPEC 15.1] and the number says how much circuit</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// an A3 holds: the parts are drawn in sheet px [SPEC 16.6], so 10 fits these</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// seven blocks on the sheet edge to edge.</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-prop">density</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">5.5</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span>

  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// A power flag is a one-line define with intrinsic text [SPEC 8/16.4]: the</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// symbol's connection point sits at its bottom, so a chain ending in one</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// grows **up** out of the pin it feeds. Three rails and a chassis stud are</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// the sheet's global labels — the reason a rail wants no tag on every pin it</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// reaches; `|gnd|` ships as a built-in define beside them.</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type-user">v24</span><span class="lini-tok-op">::</span><span class="lini-tok-type">label</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">symbol</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> power<span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">[</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;24V&quot;</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-punct">]</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type-user">v5</span><span class="lini-tok-op">::</span><span class="lini-tok-type">label</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">symbol</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> power<span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">[</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;5V&quot;</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-punct">]</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type-user">v3</span><span class="lini-tok-op">::</span><span class="lini-tok-type">label</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">symbol</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> power<span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">[</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;3V3&quot;</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-punct">]</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type-user">chassis</span><span class="lini-tok-op">::</span><span class="lini-tok-type">label</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">symbol</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> chassis<span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>

  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// The captioned block: a `|group|` that is its own schematic scope, so one</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// node both frames the block and seats what is inside it [SPEC 16.6]. It</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// states no `gap:` — the sheet's own coarse pitch is the lattice every part</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// centre lands on [SPEC 16.1], and a block that overrode it would draw on a</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// grid of its own.</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// …and its caption sits **inside** the frame it names, as a sheet titles</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// a block [SPEC 16.6] — a diagram's would stand above the corner, in the</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-comment">// gutter a tiled page has no room for.</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type-user">region</span><span class="lini-tok-op">::</span><span class="lini-tok-type">group</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">layout</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-keyword">schematic</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
<span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>

<span class="lini-tok-comment">// The page is an ordinary container inside its frame [SPEC 15.8], so the blocks</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// take a grid: fixed tracks, each sized to the widest and tallest block the</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// lattice draws in it, stretched to tile the sheet edge to edge. The</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// bottom-right cell is left empty for the title block, which takes no cell at</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// all — a `|title-block|` is pulled out of the flow and pinned flush inside the</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// frame's corner [SPEC 15.8]. `padding:` clears the frame, which is inset</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// 10 mm from the trimmed edge, so no block draws over it.</span>
<span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">page</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-prop">sheet</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> a3 landscape<span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">layout</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-keyword">grid</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">columns</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">680</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">,</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">790</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">,</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">610</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">rows</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">460</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">,</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">440</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">,</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">500</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">padding</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">0</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">gap</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">24</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">align</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-keyword">stretch</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">justify</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-keyword">stretch</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span>
<span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">[</span>

  <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type-user">region</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">entry</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;24 V entry&quot;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">cell</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">1</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">1</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">[</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// The high-side switch faces its feed: the pfet glyph presents the</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// channel pins on its right, and a half turn re-sides them at the fuse</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// — read at lowering, every text upright [SPEC 16.1] — so the 24 V path</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// runs straight through instead of orbiting the body.</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">Q</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">Q1</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;AOD4185&quot;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">symbol</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> pfet<span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">cell</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">2</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">1</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">rotate</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">180</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// `pins: N` gives a connector one column of pins, facing left; the header</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// sits at the sheet's edge, so it is flipped to face its circuit —</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// `mirror: y-axis` re-sides the column with pin 1 still on top, where</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// `rotate: 180` would put it at the bottom [SPEC 16.1/16.2].</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">J</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">J1</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;JST XH&quot;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">pins</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">2</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">cell</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">1</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">1</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">mirror</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-keyword">y-axis</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">F</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">F1</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;2A&quot;</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">D</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">D1</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;SMAJ24A&quot;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">symbol</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> tvs<span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">R</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">R1</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;100k&quot;</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">C</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">C1</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;470u&quot;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">symbol</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> polarized<span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>

    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// Reverse-polarity protection. `cell:` places an anchor on the scope's own</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// track grid, so the terminal block leads and the FET follows [SPEC 16.1];</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// the fuse between them is a **two-ended** chain, its satellite dropped on</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// the line joining the two pins. The feed rides the block's **top** screw</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// and the two returns the ones below it, so the returns drop straight to</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// their studs instead of crossing back over the line they came in beside.</span>
    J1.p1 <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> F1 <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> Q1.s
    J1.p2 <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">gnd</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// Everything the fused rail carries hangs under the one straight bus: the</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// indicator sits **after** the fuse, so a lit LED says the fuse is good.</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// Cathode first — polarity in a wire is a pin path [SPEC 16.3].</span>
    Q1.s <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> D1.k <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">gnd</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span>
    Q1.g <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> R1 <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">gnd</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span>
    Q1.d <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> C1 <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">gnd</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span>
    Q1.d <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type-user">v24</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span>
  <span class="lini-tok-punct">]</span>

  <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type-user">region</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">buck</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;5 V buck&quot;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">cell</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">2</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">1</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">[</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">component</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">U1</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;LM2596S-5.0&quot;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">[</span>
      <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">pin</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">VIN</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">side</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-keyword">left</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">number</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">1</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
      <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">pin</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">ONOFF</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;ON/OFF&quot;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">side</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-keyword">left</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">number</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">5</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
      <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">pin</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">GND</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">side</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-keyword">bottom</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">number</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">3</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
      <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">pin</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">OUT</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">side</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-keyword">right</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">number</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">2</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
      <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">pin</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">FB</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">side</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-keyword">right</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">number</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> <span class="lini-tok-number">4</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">]</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">C</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">C2</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;100n&quot;</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">R</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">R3</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;10k&quot;</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">L</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">L1</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;100u&quot;</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">D</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">D3</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;SS54&quot;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">symbol</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> schottky<span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">C</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">C3</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;220u&quot;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">{</span> <span class="lini-tok-prop">symbol</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">:</span> polarized<span class="lini-tok-punct">;</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">}</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">R</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">R4</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;4k7&quot;</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">LED</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">#</span><span class="lini-tok-type">D4</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span> <span class="lini-tok-string">&quot;blue&quot;</span>

    U1.VIN <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type-user">v24</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span>
    U1.VIN <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> C2 <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">gnd</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span>
    U1.ONOFF <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> R3 <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">gnd</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span>
    U1.GND <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type">gnd</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// A chain passes **through** a two-pin part [SPEC 16.5], so the switch node,</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// the inductor and the rail flag are one statement — and the catch diode</span>
    <span class="lini-tok-comment">// forking off the same pin dots the junction.</span>
    U1.OUT <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> L1 <span class="lini-tok-op">-</span> <span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span><span class="lini-tok-type-user">v5</span><span class="lini-tok-punct">|</span>
